      "note": "ROUND 391 \u2014 THE one writer for a GL posting line. It inserts the posting and its accounting.transaction_source_links row in the caller's transaction and throws if the line carries no source_transaction_type/id, so a posting without lineage is not writable. It is not a new way to create money: it is the single implementation the existing doors call. Measured live 2026-10-03 \u2014 7,909 postings vs 4,355 spine rows, because nine services insert postings directly and only fuel-posting also wrote the spine. The journal entry linkage IS carried, as the real column name journal_entry_uuid \u2014 the register's stamp list uses journal_entry_id, which this file does not spell, so it is declared missing rather than claimed falsely. load_id is stamped by accounting.posting_source_load_id() in the same INSERT, resolved from the posting's own source document. The remaining stamps are the SOURCE DOCUMENT's to carry \u2014 this writer never invents a driver, unit, trailer, customer, vendor, settlement, invoice or item that its caller did not supply. Reversal is accounting/void.service.ts, unchanged: reverse the entry, never edit or delete the posting."
    },
